iimg.com/photo/msid-135937461,imgsize-82414.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Van Gogh Auction Challenge: Heirs seek to halt Sotheby’s sale; auction house disputes duress]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135892208.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Descendants of German publisher Samuel Fischer have requested Sotheby’s to withdraw a Van Gogh painting from auction. They argue the painting's sale in 1936 resulted from Nazi persecution and associated pressures. Samuel Fischer acquired the artwork in 1909, and it changed hands under questionable circumstances after his death. Sotheby’s claims there is no evidence of duress in the sale, but they are engaging with the family.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-van-gogh-painting-expected-to-fetch-180-million-at-sothebys-in-new-york-faces-a-last-minute-challenge-heirs-of-its-former-jewish-owners-say-a-1936-sale-was-forced-by-nazi-persecution-and-want-the-auction-stopped/articleshow/135892208.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-van-gogh-painting-expected-to-fetch-180-million-at-sothebys-in-new-york-faces-a-last-minute-challenge-heirs-of-its-former-jewish-owners-say-a-1936-sale-was-forced-by-nazi-persecution-and-want-the-auction-stopped/articleshow/135892208.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-18T00:01:27+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135892326,imgsize-600264.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Jeff Bezos donates $199 million worth of Amazon shares to charities, retains stock worth $226 billion]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135936790.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Jeff Bezos has donated nearly $199 million worth of Amazon shares to nonprofit organisations, taking his stock contributions in 2026 to approximately $629 million. Despite the latest donation, the Amazon founder holds shares worth $226.4 billion. The story also looks at his philanthropy alongside wife Lauren Sanchez Bezos and former wife MacKenzie Scott.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/jeff-bezos-donates-nearly-199-million-worth-of-amazon-shares-to-charities-retains-stock-worth-226-billion-inside-his-629-million-philanthropy-drive-in-2026/articleshow/135936790.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/jeff-bezos-donates-nearly-199-million-worth-of-amazon-shares-to-charities-retains-stock-worth-226-billion-inside-his-629-million-philanthropy-drive-in-2026/articleshow/135936790.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-17T23:52:10+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135937229,imgsize-53754.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Madonna's former Hamptons rental, a nine-bedroom mansion, listed for $20 million]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135917296.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Nestled in the luxurious enclave of Water Mill, New York, this stunning nine-bedroom estate is making waves on the market with a price tag of $20 million. Featuring lavish amenities like two gourmet kitchens, a sparkling pool, and a private tennis court, this villa has hosted high-profile guests, including the iconic Madonna. Purchased for $6.65 million during the pandemic, the owners have occasionally rented it out while considering resale options.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/madonna-once-rented-this-14500-square-foot-hamptons-mansion-the-renovated-nine-bedroom-water-mill-estate-with-two-kitchens-a-pool-and-a-tennis-court-is-now-listed-for-20-million/articleshow/135917296.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/madonna-once-rented-this-14500-square-foot-hamptons-mansion-the-renovated-nine-bedroom-water-mill-estate-with-two-kitchens-a-pool-and-a-tennis-court-is-now-listed-for-20-million/articleshow/135917296.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-18T00:00:04+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Lifestyle Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135917419,imgsize-1562521.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[JD Vance breaks silence on US outages, tells Americans whether they should stockpile food and water or build bunkers]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135935922.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/jd-vance-breaks-silence-on-us-outages-tells-americans-whether-they-should-stockpile-food-and-water-or-build-bunkers/articleshow/135935922.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/jd-vance-breaks-silence-on-us-outages-tells-americans-whether-they-should-stockpile-food-and-water-or-build-bunkers/articleshow/135935922.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-17T23:22:55+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Poulomi Ghosh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135936005,imgsize-59656.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[US loses measles elimination status amid worst outbreak since 1991]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135935577.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-loses-measles-elimination-status-amid-worst-outbreak-since-1991/articleshow/135935577.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-loses-measles-elimination-status-amid-worst-outbreak-since-1991/articleshow/135935577.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-17T23:11:33+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aashish Vashistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135935598,imgsize-141304.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Ohio contractor wins appeal over $270,000 property after county challenges its commercial use]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135933461.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Jackson &amp; Jackson, LLC is challenging Butler County's zoning rules that prevent it from operating its business. The Ohio Court of Appeals has restored two of its claims regarding property rights and compensation. In November 2021, the company purchased a property with a history of commercial use for $270,000. The Lower court initially dismissed all three claims, leading to the appeal.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2021-an-ohio-electrical-contractor-paid-270000-for-nine-acres-previously-used-as-a-golf-range-pizza-shop-and-church-after-the-county-challenged-its-business-use-an-appeals-court-revived-two-claims/articleshow/135933461.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2021-an-ohio-electrical-contractor-paid-270000-for-nine-acres-previously-used-as-a-golf-range-pizza-shop-and-church-after-the-county-challenged-its-business-use-an-appeals-court-revived-two-claims/articleshow/135933461.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-17T23:00:12+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135934730,imgsize-191