tic.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135887924,imgsize-1879375.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[95-year-old widow faces £1m legal bill after losing appeal in decade-long fence dispute]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135929374.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A 95-year-old widow is liable for over £1 million in legal fees following a lengthy dispute with her neighbours. Margaret Kinnear contested the boundary line concerning a small plot of land in Kent. Despite winning a trespass claim, she must cover her own legal expenses after the court's decision. The High Court dismissed her appeal, stating the original judge's ruling was valid and justified.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/a-95-year-old-british-widow-faces-legal-costs-exceeding-1-million-after-a-10-year-fence-dispute-over-about-45-square-metres-of-land-despite-winning-damages-for-trespass-a-judge-has-now-dismissed-her-appeal/articleshow/135929374.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/a-95-year-old-british-widow-faces-legal-costs-exceeding-1-million-after-a-10-year-fence-dispute-over-about-45-square-metres-of-land-despite-winning-damages-for-trespass-a-judge-has-now-dismissed-her-appeal/articleshow/135929374.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-17T22:01:44+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135933397,imgsize-2053556.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Bella Hadid donates $50,000 for winter shelter kits for displaced Gaza families]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135932940.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Bella Hadid has pledged $50,000 to provide urgent shelter for families in Gaza. This generous donation will fund waterproof tents, blankets, and mattresses for 100 families displaced by the ongoing crisis. As winter conditions worsen and flooding becomes more severe, the demand for shelter has soared. Hadid appeals for others to join the cause, highlighting the essential need for survival and dignity amidst this humanitarian disaster.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/in-november-2026-model-bella-hadid-donated-50000-toward-winter-shelter-kits-for-100-displaced-families-in-gaza-including-waterproof-tents-mattresses-and-blankets-after-heavy-rain-worsened-conditions/articleshow/135932940.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/in-november-2026-model-bella-hadid-donated-50000-toward-winter-shelter-kits-for-100-displaced-families-in-gaza-including-waterproof-tents-mattresses-and-blankets-after-heavy-rain-worsened-conditions/articleshow/135932940.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-17T21:54:58+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135933099,imgsize-97666.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Scottish Highlands launch 100-year project to revive lost forests, wetlands and wildlife]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135932507.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[The Scottish Highlands are undergoing a 100-year restoration project led by the Durrell Wildlife Conservation Trust to revive lost forests, wetlands and wildlife. Covering a 7,500-hectare estate in the Cairngorms National Park, the initiative aims to reverse centuries of environmental damage through peatland restoration, native tree planting and scientific monitoring for future generations.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/nature/with-over-90-of-native-forests-lost-80-of-peatlands-damaged-and-nearly-half-of-biodiversity-gone-scottish-highlands-begin-a-100-year-restoration-project-across-7500-hectares-to-revive-lost-ecosystems/articleshow/135932507.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/nature/with-over-90-of-native-forests-lost-80-of-peatlands-damaged-and-nearly-half-of-biodiversity-gone-scottish-highlands-begin-a-100-year-restoration-project-across-7500-hectares-to-revive-lost-ecosystems/articleshow/135932507.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-17T21:42:17+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135932649,imgsize-219244.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Sikh man serving life for killing UK student Henry Nowak seeks appeal against conviction]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135932109.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/sikh-man-serving-life-for-killing-uk-student-henry-nowak-seeks-appeal-against-murder-conviction/articleshow/135932109.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/sikh-man-serving-life-for-killing-uk-student-henry-nowak-seeks-appeal-against-murder-conviction/articleshow/135932109.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-17T21:25:37+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Gokul Ankari</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135932228,imgsize-1275431.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Top secret US national security communications network goes down: Report]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135932100.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/americas-spy-agency-goes-dark-nsas-classified-internal-network-goes-down-no-cyberattack-evidence-yet-report/articleshow/135932100.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/americas-spy-agency-goes-dark-nsas-classified-internal-network-goes-down-no-cyberattack-evidence-yet-report/articleshow/135932100.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-17T21:21:29+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Prisha Patnaik</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135932139,imgsize-98270.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[95-year-old widow loses £1m appeal after 10-year dispute over 45-sq-metre garden strip]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135929038.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A 95-year-old widow has lost her High Court appeal over a £1 million-plus legal bill following a decade-long boundary dispute with her neighbours in Kent. Despite winning some claims in the original case, Mary Egan failed to establish her preferred property boundary. The court upheld an earlier decision requiring both sides to bear their own legal costs.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/a-95-year-old-british-widow-faces-legal-costs-exceeding-1-million-after-a-10-year-fence-dispute-over-about-45-square-metres-of-land-despite-winning-damages-for-trespass-a-judge-has-now-dismissed-her-appeal/articleshow/135929374.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/a-95-year-old-british-widow-faces-legal-costs-exceeding-1-million-after-a-10-year-fence-dispute-over-about-45-square-metres-of-land-despite-winning-damages-for-trespass-a-judge-has-now-dismissed-her-appeal/articleshow/135929374.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-17T20:31:17+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creat